# 统一换行：仓库内一律 LF，Windows 检出时只对 .bat/.cmd 用 CRLF
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制
*.exe binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite binary
*.sqlite3 binary

# 不要参与语言统计
*.svg linguist-documentation
docs/** linguist-documentation
designs/** linguist-documentation
